{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】銅鑼灣一間電器舖有相機和鏡頭疑被職員偷去。</p>\n<p>銅鑼灣時代廣場一間店舖，有61部相機及55個鏡頭不翼而飛，總值約188萬元。警方將案件列作盜竊跟進，追緝約40歲男子。據了解是店舖職員。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.471765+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":98,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T15:19:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:59.601652+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:59.601652+00:00","content_hash":"b2fff4937e8c2a7e4c94741d4e11caa1861a8bc6f2b3a6092aae2560e6c5f59a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}